## Scope and precedence

Unless a file says otherwise:

- documentation and static visual assets follow CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
- source code, configuration, and extension runtime files follow PolyForm
  Noncommercial 1.0.0

If a file mixes explanation and code, the explanatory text follows CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and
the code example follows PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0. A file-specific license notice
takes precedence over this default rule.

